# Apply order for the vLLM patches, one basename per line.
#
# The Dockerfile and prepare/patch_vllm.py apply in THIS order, not glob
# order. A few patches carry hunk context that an earlier patch adds (e.g.
# prefill-attn-int8.patch inserts before spec-decode-attn.patch's split-KV
# block and carries its lines as context), so order is a hard requirement.
#
#   - the entries are upstream's series (the upstream/synced commit) minus
#     the seven files for lanes this repo does not ship: dflash2-backport
#     (retired, DFlash2 is native in 0.28.0), offload-wsl2-devptr and
#     offload-mtp-serve (WSL2 / single-user offload), engine-completion-
#     log, engine-stall-sentinel, sse-keep-alive (their harness), and
#     triton-spec-attn-fp8-kv (fp8 KV is excluded here)
#   - the three kvarn patches close the series, after the main set, the way
#     upstream's Dockerfile applies them after its series: kvarn-v2-runner
#     needs the KVarN base and the DFlash2 patches beneath it
#
